OL,3,CAlex Scott makes first England start
OL,4,Cin record-breaking win over Croatia
OL,6,FGuernsey footballer Alex Scott made
OL,7,Fhis first start for England as the
OL,8,FThree Lions thrashed Croatia in the
OL,9,FUEFA Nations League.
OL,11,FIt was the 23-year-old's second
OL,12,Fsuccessive international appearance
OL,13,Fafter earning his first cap on Tuesday
OL,14,Fagainst Czechia.
OL,16,FPartnered alongside Manchester City's
OL,17,FElliot Anderson in midfield, Scott
OL,18,Fhelped England deliver a masterclass
OL,19,Fto inflict a 7-0 defeat on the Croats
OL,20,F- their heaviest ever loss.
