PN,35102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F351A1791381055
OL,3,CAlex Scott makes first England start
OL,4,Cin record-breaking win over Croatia
OL,6,FThe Bournemouth playmaker was tidy in
OL,7,Fpossession and never looked out of
OL,8,Fplace alongside some of the world's
OL,9,Fbest including Harry Kane, Jude
OL,10,FBellingham, Bukayo Saka and Anthony
OL,11,FGordon.
OL,13,FHe even helped set up England's opener
OL,14,Fwith a slick pass into Bellingham
OL,15,Fbefore Kane's clinical finish.
OL,17,FThe Bournemouth playmaker will now be
OL,18,Fhoping to earn his first cap at home
OL,19,Fon Tuesday when the Three Lions take
OL,20,Fon Czechia at Wembley.
